/*
 * BLAKE2s test vectors — provenance documented per AGENTS.md 5.6.
 *
 * Unkeyed: RFC 7693 Appendix B ("" and "abc").
 *
 * Keyed 32-byte out: subset of the official Known Answer Tests from the
 * BLAKE2 reference package (https://github.com/BLAKE2/BLAKE2,
 * testvectors/blake2-kat.json @ commit
 * ed1974ea83433eba7b2d95c5dcd9ac33cb847913, fetched 2026-08-24).
 * All entries use key = 000102..1f; input lengths cover block boundaries.
 * Full official set (256 entries) cross-checked against Python 3.12
 * hashlib.blake2s with 0 mismatches before subsetting.
 *
 * Keyed 16-byte out: absent from the official KAT; generated with
 * Python 3.12 hashlib.blake2s (independent RFC 7693 implementation) as a
 * dual-implementation check. digest_size is an internal hash parameter,
 * NOT truncation of the 32-byte digest.
 *
 * Do not edit by hand. Regenerate from the cited sources instead.
 */
